# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Original camera files in assets/img/travel/
#
# The site only uses the converted, resized copies, which are named
# country.jpg or country-city.jpg — lowercase, hyphens only, no spaces.
# Every original has a space or an underscore in its filename
# ("Spain_July 2022.jpg", "Monument Valley Arizona_Jan 2024.jpeg"),
# so that is what we match on. Together they are ~72MB.
#
# NOTE: git on Windows sets core.ignorecase=true, so patterns are matched
# case-insensitively. Do NOT add "*.JPG" or "[A-Z]*" here — they would also
# match austria.jpg and friends and silently drop every photo from the site.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
assets/img/travel/*[ _]*

# Extensions the site never uses (safe: no .jpg collision under ignorecase)
assets/img/travel/*.HEIC
assets/img/travel/*.heic
assets/img/travel/*.jpeg

# Local tool settings, not part of the website
.claude/settings.local.json

# R
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/

# OS / editor cruft
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
